[
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 1,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "承接上一课，我们来看马鞍面函数 f(x,y) = x² - y²。首先求偏导数：f_x = 2x，f_y = -2y。在原点(0,0)处，两个偏导数都为0，因此原点梯度为零。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "content": {
              "latex": "f(x,y) = x^2 - y^2 \\implies f_x(0,0)=0, \\ f_y(0,0)=0 \\implies \\nabla f(0,0) = (0,0)"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "intent": "强调原点偏导数计算结果与梯度为零",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "回想第一课的抛物面 x² + y²，它在原点同样梯度为零且是最低点。那么，梯度为零就一定是最低点吗？我们同时观察两幅马鞍面，左图切面为 y=0，右图切面为 x=0。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
