            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们在马鞍面 $z = x^2 - y^2$ 上分别沿着 $x$ 轴与 $y$ 轴方向切开，观察降维后的路径函数。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              }
            ],
            "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
            "timing": "after_speech"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "在 $y=0$ 的截面上，函数化简为 $z = x^2$。以参数 $t$ 表示该路径，就是 $z = t^2$。此时原点在 $x$ 方向上是最低点。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "y=0 \\implies z = x^2 \\implies z(t) = t^2 \\quad (t=x)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "z(t,0) = t^2 \\text{ (极小值)}, \\quad z(0,t) = -t^2 \\text{ (极大值)}"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "观察沿x方向开口向上的抛物线截面",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "而在 $x=0$ 的截面上，函数化简为 $z = -y^2$。用参数 $t$ 表示该路径，就是 $z = -t^2$。原点在 $y$ 方向上反而是最高点。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "x=0 \\implies z = -y^2 \\implies z(t) = -t^2 \\quad (t=y)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 1,
              "item": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "我们把这两条截面曲线画在同一坐标系中对比。横轴为路径参数 $t$，纵轴为高度 $z$。上方曲线对应路径 $(t,0)$，下方曲线对应路径 $(0,t)$。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "function_plot",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "截面路径参数曲线对照图",
                "x_label": "t",
                "y_label": "z",
                "curve_labels": [
                  "(x,y)=(t,0)",
                  "(x,y)=(0,t)"
                ],
                "expressions": [
                  "(x)^(2)",
                  "-((x)^(2))"
                ]
              }
            },
            "role": "main_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            },
            "reusable_item": 2
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "比较两条方向相反极值特性的路径曲线",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 4,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 3,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们来严格证明原点不是极值点。在原点任意小的邻域内，我们取两类特殊点：沿x轴的点(t,0)和沿y轴的点(0,t)，其中t不等于0。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引出邻域内两类特殊点的代数式",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "代入函数，f(t,0)等于t的平方，大于0；f(0,t)等于负t的平方，小于0；而原点函数值f(0,0)等于0。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "f(t,0)=t^2>0, \\quad f(0,t)=-t^2<0, \\quad f(0,0)=0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "因为这两类点可以任意靠近原点，所以在原点的任何邻域内，都同时存在比原点函数值更高和更低的点。这直接违背了局部极大值和局部极小值的定义。",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "鞍点的代数本质",
              "items": [
                "任意邻域内同时存在 f(x,y) > f(0,0) 与 f(x,y) < f(0,0)",
                "一升一降即可否定极值点",
                "注意：仅两个方向上升尚不能证明全局极小"
              ]
            },
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "因此，即便梯度为零，原点也既不是局部极大点，也不是局部极小点，这就是鞍点的本质。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "intent": "总结鞍点与梯度为零的关系",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 4,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "今天我们总结多元函数极值分析的三种核心视角。第一，固定输出看等高线；第二，固定输入看偏导数；第三，通过比较经过同一点的不同路径，来判断该点是否为极值点。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "多元函数极值分析方法体系",
              "items": [
                "固定输出：观察等高线形态与分布",
                "固定输入：计算一阶偏导数与梯度",
                "路径分析：比较过同一点的不同方向曲线"
              ]
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 3,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "intent": "梳理多元函数极值分析的三大核心方法",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "我们将旋转抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方，与马鞍面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方在原点处进行对比。两者的梯度在原点均为零向量，但极值性质截然不同。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\nabla z(0,0) = (0, 0)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "对于旋转抛物面，原点任意邻域内的函数值都大于等于零，因此原点是严格局部极小值点；而对于马鞍面，原点任意邻域内既存在正值也存在负值，因此原点不是极值点，而是鞍点。",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\text{抛物面: } f(x,y) \\ge f(0,0) \\quad | \\quad \\text{马鞍面: } \\Delta f \\text{ 符号不固定}"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "最后留下一个概念自查思考题：如果一个曲面在某点沿 x 轴和 y 轴两个方向都达到局部极小，我们能否断言该点就是多元函数的局部极小值点？为什么？",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "概念反思自查",
              "items": [
                "问题：沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向均上升，能否断言局部极小？",
                "思考：坐标轴方向能否代表全方位邻域的变化？"
              ]
            },
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 3,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "答案是不能。因为坐标轴方向仅代表两个特定切平面方向。即便沿着 x 轴和 y 轴方向函数值都增加，在其他斜向路径上函数值仍可能减小。判断极小值必须保证在全方位完整邻域内函数值均不小于该点。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\text{结论: 不能。必须满足 } \\forall (x,y) \\in U(p_0), f(x,y) \\ge f(p_0)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 4,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "intent": "明确极值定义的邻域全方位性要求",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 5,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
